sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Tech as Field tech
  participant UI as Fleet UI
  participant API as REST API
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant MQ as MQTT ACL
  participant Dev as Device

  Tech->>UI: scan QR (serial)
  UI->>API: POST /v1/devices {serial, site}
  API->>DB: INSERT devices
  DB-->>API: 201 + deviceId
  API->>MQ: grant pub tel/v1/{id}/#
  API-->>UI: 201 Location

  par certificate
    UI->>API: POST /v1/devices/{id}/certs
    API->>API: issue mTLS
    API-->>UI: PEM bundle
  and first-seen
    Dev->>API: GET /v1/devices/{id} (mTLS)
    API-->>Dev: 200 config
    Dev->>MQ: PUBLISH status online
  end

  alt serial unknown
    API-->>UI: 404
  else already claimed
    API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
  end
